nMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Qmrw1chFGn3skbWFEyxYCQ","review_id":"tKil7aUQ-KOu6pAyC2JDdw","date":"2013-05-16T04:20:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9482975006103516,"text_excerpt":"Wow. This was our first meal of our week long NOLA trip, and we started it off with a bang. I expected this place to be good, but it far exceeded those expectations and then some. We were seated immediately with our reservation and had excellent service from our personable waiter. He was very good and the perfect level of professional and friendly. I'm not a fan of a phony-nice server, and this guy was definitely legit. We got the fried green tomatoes with shrimp remoulade appetizer and it was just as incredible as it sounds. We also got the BBQ shrimp... and this is where Dick & Jenny took us to a new level. I've had Jacque-Imo's, I've had Mr. B's... and this was the best BBQ shrimp I ha..."},{"business_id":"Qmrw1chFGn3skbWFEyxYCQ","review_id":"LwThSJeHohUCeTwIxGNR1g","date":"2012-03-27T01:04:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9411422610282898,"text_excerpt":"NOTE: Save this meal to be your last if visiting NOLA. Read on... Dick & Jenny's ruined our trip to NOLA. D&J's set the bar so damn high that every morsel we put in our mouth from then on just lead us to say \"This is good... but remember D&J's...\" So thank you D&J, for destroying my dreams of endless \"aha! moments\" while in this magnificent city... We ordered the soup du jour, which was crab bisque topped with a crab beignet. This dish was awesome - the soup was incredibly rich and flavorful and the crab beignet is everything you would imagine a perfect crab beignet would be. It enhanced the best qualities in the ingredients - the sweetness and meatiness of the crab plus the fluffiness an..."},{"business_id":"Qmrw1chFGn3skbWFEyxYCQ","review_id":"7dg-bOlgx08d2e9bbeKJHQ","date":"2017-03-20T16:52:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9380029439926147,"text_excerpt":"I've driven by Dick & Jenny's probably hundreds of times. And I've had friends tell me good things about it for years. But I just recently had my first experience there. It did not disappoint. I liked the rustic and cozy feel of the restaurant. The tables aren't too close together and it didn't seem to get too loud. The service was good, too. Robert was attentive and friendly, but no annoying or pushy. But what it's really about is the food, right? I started with the corn-fried oysters. YUM! Loved the slaw under them, too. My wife had the beet salad (I think). I didn't hear any complaints. For my entrée, I had the black drum. I really liked it. Flavor was good and seasoning was just right..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Qmrw1chFGn3skbWFEyxYCQ","photo_id":"eOgdpHaNjhamUy0arNuzbw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/eOgdpHaNjhamUy0arNuzbw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8624388575553894},{"business_id":"Qmrw1chFGn3skbWFEyxYCQ","photo_id":"qu5dl1gKdjyq2uVK_FAy3w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/qu5dl1gKdjyq2uVK_FAy3w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7955127358436584},{"business_id":"Qmrw1chFGn3skbWFEyxYCQ","photo_id":"9f-609k0cCVCpOfvfvi0Lw","label":"f